    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῡράμῐνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>) poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρινος</span>, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριθάμινος</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίθινος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheaten</i>, 
